        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-3249, Melon Cabinet Knob With Button Center</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRK International's Melon Knob is available with either a 1-1/4 inch diameter or a 1-1/2 inch diameter. It features a classic design, but what sets this cabinet pull apart from similar shaped hardware is the wide array of finishes in which it is available (click picture to see them all). Each of the 9 finishes are beautiful and grant their own aura to this melon-shaped cabinet knob.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/smooth-melon-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-3250\"><b>Melon Cabinet Knob With Smooth Center</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/half-melon-cup-pull-rk-international-cf-5251\"><b>Half Melon Cup Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-3249 Melon Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-3249:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-3248:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
